WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.894
The tests cover the collector and the live
pieces: seven tests for the OCI block

2
00:00:04.894 --> 00:00:09.663
of the collectors, plus the live tests
for the list command and the realm guard.

3
00:00:09.663 --> 00:00:11.224
The lab runs nine of them.

4
00:00:11.224 --> 00:00:13.700
But be clear about what
this code isn't yet.

5
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:17.521
The live reader was tested
against stand-in CLI output,

6
00:00:17.521 --> 00:00:22.275
not a live tenancy, so review it and
run Lab 2 before it reads a real one.

7
00:00:22.275 --> 00:00:25.088
And two things are
still not yet specified:

8
00:00:25.088 --> 00:00:29.347
which key casing the CLI actually
prints, so the kit accepts both,

9
00:00:29.347 --> 00:00:33.740
and the Announcements endpoint in
realm O C 3, so the kit refuses it.
